OL,3,AAvanti West Coast main line to be
OL,4,Anationalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvanti West Coast train services will
OL,7,Fbe nationalised from March next year,
OL,8,Fthe government has announced.
OL,10,F"For years, we've heard stories of
OL,11,FAvanti underperforming, with passengers
OL,12,Fleft paying the price. Enough is
OL,13,Fenough," Transport Secretary Heidi
OL,14,FAlexander said.
OL,16,FThe move is part of a government plan
OL,17,Fto improve rail infrastructure, cut
OL,18,Ftrain delays and improve experiences
OL,19,Ffor passengers.
OL,21,FAvanti West Coast's contract was due to
OL,22,Fcome to an end on 7 March.
